    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >his is a simple ear training game I made to help you recognize notes, chords, and intervals by ear. It's great if you're learning music or just want to get better at identifying sounds. No stress, just play and improve at your own pace.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Guess notes, chords, and intervals</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Practice your ear with short rounds</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clean and simple design</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Good for beginners and pros</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Built by a musician, for musicians</p></li></ul>",
